      "**Dehghani, Atran, and colleagues (2010)** and **Dehghani, Iliev, and colleagues (2009)** examined these issues for **Iran’s nuclear program**. They asked whether people treating it as sacred would be willing to compromise in response to material benefits or penalties.",
